# SeedVR2 runtime dependencies, compiled into requirements.txt with:
#   uv pip compile seedvr2/requirements.in -o seedvr2/requirements.txt \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 \
#     --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128 --extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple \
#     --index-strategy unsafe-best-match --exclude-newer 2025-12-25
# (from apps/api; see the seedvr2 stage of the Dockerfile). --exclude-newer
# holds every package to what existed when the pinned CLI commit was made.
#
# Upstream's requirements.txt (numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler) minus
# matplotlib (unused by the CLI), with opencv-python swapped for the headless
# build (no GUI libraries in the image). PyTorch 2.9 with CUDA 12.8 is the
# newest release upstream targets and has Blackwell (sm_120) kernels.
